OL,3,ADallas Cowboys Cheerleaders star
OL,4,Aimpresses on Broadway after celebrity
OL,5,Acasting row
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Dallas Cowboys Cheerleader Reece
OL,8,FWeaver has shelved her cowboy boots and
OL,9,Fswapped the football pitch for the
OL,10,Fstage as she steps into one of the most
OL,11,Ffamous roles in the world.
OL,13,FWeaver was a breakout star of the
OL,14,FNetflix docuseries America's
OL,15,FSweethearts: Dallas Cowboys
OL,16,FCheerleaders, with her exit from the
OL,17,Fsquad a major storyline of the third
OL,18,Fseason.
