OL,3,ADallas Cowboys Cheerleaders star
OL,4,Aimpresses on Broadway after celebrity
OL,5,Acasting row
OL,6,
OL,7,FMaking her Broadway debut in the
OL,8,Fmusical Chicago, she faced criticism
OL,9,Fthat it was her profile, more than her
OL,10,Ftalent, which landed her the role.
OL,12,FAfter much fan speculation, she
OL,13,Fofficially stepped into the role of
OL,14,Fmurderess Roxie Hart this week at New
OL,15,FYork's Ambassador Theatre.
